            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SnackTray 1.3.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Snapped windows give their size back. Drag a window out of its zone and it returns to the size it was before you snapped it, staying under your cursor as it goes. It remembers the size from before the first snap, so moving a window from one zone to another and then out still gives you back the window you started with.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
